      "value": "@{59b15c3e62dfd809eb1144d3|full_name}: some more triggers that would be useful.\n\nfirst: reset pickups. a way to reset the positions of picksups without needing to throw them off the world\n\nsecond: a random trigger.  a trigger that lets your pick a number, say 5, then you get 5 slots and it lets you place 5 triggers in each of those slots in some way. Maybe a field next to reach slot that lets you type in the probability that trigger will happen, so your can set one as 90% and another as 10%",
